      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Just four runners face the starter. EAGLEFURTHER (3) tackled four opponents here last Friday over this distance and got the job done in good style to make it two on the bounce. Meets a couple of smarter ones this evening but drops 2.5kgs which brings her right under notice. ALPINE FURY (2) has won two from two this time in work, both over 1400m at this track. Has only been this deep into a prep once before and failed which is a niggling concern, as is his first try at 1600m. Poses a threat all the same. TUSKEGEE (1) raced handy but lacked a change of gears over 1400m here recently. The winner of three from six at the mile so he can run a much better race without surprising. SIR JAG (5) has won just three from fifty but could surprise in the small field following a sound effort in a Class 3 over this course and distance last time.",
